## Verification & Expected Outcome
Run `verify.sh` or check cluster status:
```bash
kubectl get statefulset app
```
Expected Output:
```
NAME   READY   AGE
app    3/3     5m
```
All 3 pods (`app-0`, `app-1`, `app-2`) must show `READY 1/1` and status `Running` with `0` active restarts on `app-2`.
